<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Music Theory App</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            max-width: 980px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px 60px;
            text-align: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: #1f2b4a;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 12% 10%, #ffe87a 0 8%, transparent 9%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 88% 12%, #ff9dd5 0 7%, transparent 8%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 10% 84%, #86ffd5 0 8%, transparent 9%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 86% 88%, #8ad4ff 0 9%, transparent 10%),
                linear-gradient(160deg, #fff4d6 0%, #ffe0f0 35%, #ddf8ff 72%, #e4ffef 100%);
        }
        .header {
            margin: 26px 0 44px;
            background: #ffffffdc;
            padding: 36px 34px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 3px solid #ffd66c;
            box-shadow: 0 14px 0 #ffc24f, 0 24px 38px rgba(31, 43, 74, 0.16);
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #2d2d7a;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4.8vw, 2.9rem);
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .header p {
            color: #3e4b77;
            font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.2vw, 1.18rem);
            line-height: 1.62;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .header a {
            color: #6d2cf3;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
            text-underline-offset: 3px;
        }
        .user-panel {
            position: sticky;
            top: 10px;
            margin-left: auto;
            text-align: right;
            width: fit-content;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 11px 18px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            border: 2px solid #e8d4ff;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(88, 62, 160, 0.16);
            z-index: 20;
        }
        .user-panel a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #5f26ce;
            font-weight: 800;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .user-panel a:hover {
            color: #431ca0;
        }
        .user-panel span {
            margin-right: 15px;
            color: #2d2d7a;
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .category-section {
            margin-bottom: 36px;
            text-align: left;
            background: #ffffffcf;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px 22px 24px;
            border: 2px solid #e5e9ff;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(58, 79, 132, 0.1);
        }
        .category-title {
            color: #2d2d7a;
            border-bottom: 3px dashed #a5b3ff;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.6vw, 1.55rem);
            font-weight: 900;
        }
        .nav-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .nav-card {
            border: none;
            padding: 18px 16px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 0 rgba(53, 57, 120, 0.15);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 135px;
        }
        .nav-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 0 rgba(53, 57, 120, 0.2);
        }
        .nav-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            color: #2d2d7a;
            font-size: 1.18rem;
            font-weight: 900;
        }
        .nav-card p {
            color: #3e4b77;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 0.98rem;
        }
        .nav-grid .nav-card:nth-child(6n + 1) { background: linear-gradient(140deg, #fff6a8, #ffe7cf); }
        .nav-grid .nav-card:nth-child(6n + 2) { background: linear-gradient(140deg, #ffc2e1, #ffd8ef); }
        .nav-grid .nav-card:nth-child(6n + 3) { background: linear-gradient(140deg, #b9f9e4, #d6fff1); }
        .nav-grid .nav-card:nth-child(6n + 4) { background: linear-gradient(140deg, #bee7ff, #d9f2ff); }
        .nav-grid .nav-card:nth-child(6n + 5) { background: linear-gradient(140deg, #e1d2ff, #efe5ff); }
        .nav-grid .nav-card:nth-child(6n + 6) { background: linear-gradient(140deg, #ffd5be, #ffe6d8); }
        .nav-grid a[href="/support_me"] {
            border: 3px solid #ffcb39;
        }
        .nav-grid a[href="/about_me"] {
            border: 3px solid #22caa4;
        }
        @media (max-width: 680px) {
            body {
                padding: 16px 14px 36px;
            }
            .user-panel {
                position: static;
                margin: 0 0 14px auto;
            }
            .header {
                padding: 28px 20px;
                margin-top: 0;
            }
            .category-section {
                padding: 16px;
            }
            .nav-card {
                min-height: 120px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="user-panel">
        <% if (user) { %>
            <span>Welcome, <%= user.user_name %>!</span>
            <a href="/chat" style="margin-right: 15px; color: #8e44ad;">🤖 AI Assistant</a>
            <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
        <% } else { %>
            <a href="/login">Login</a>
        <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="header">
        <h1>Welcome to Music Theory Cluster Online</h1>
        <p>Fun and colorful practice for music theory topics in the ABRSM Grade 5 Theory exam.<br>
            The source code is available on github: <a href="https://github.com/maxchanhi/music-theory-app" target="_blank">Music Theory Cluster Online</a>.<br>
            If you want an account, you can contact me via email: <a href="mailto:chakhangc@yahoo.com.hk">chakhangc@yahoo.com.hk</a>
        </p>
        
    </div>

    <div class="category-section">
        <h2 class="category-title">Rhythm-related</h2>
        <div class="nav-grid">
            <a href="/grouping_quiz" class="nav-card">
                <h3>Grouping and beaming</h3>
                <p>Identify correct grouping and beaming in musical notation.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/compound_simple" class="nav-card">
                <h3>Simple-compound Modulation</h3>
                <p>Practice metric modulation between simple and compound time.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/duration_equation" class="nav-card">
                <h3>Duration calculation</h3>
                <p>Calculate note durations and time signatures.</p>
            </a>
            <!-- Calculation for time signature is merged or similar to duration_equation, keeping duration_equation for now -->
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="category-section">
        <h2 class="category-title">Pitch-related</h2>
        <div class="nav-grid">
            <a href="/pitch_id" class="nav-card">
                <h3>Pitch Identification</h3>
                <p>Identify musical notes on different clefs with various accidentals.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/interval" class="nav-card">
                <h3>Interval</h3>
                <p>Identify the interval between two notes.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/chromatic" class="nav-card">
                <h3>Chromatic scale</h3>
                <p>Practice identifying chromatic scales and their notations.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/transposing" class="nav-card">
                <h3>Transposing</h3>
                <p>Practice transposing music between different keys and clefs.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/same_pitch" class="nav-card">
                <h3>Same pitches with different clefs</h3>
                <p>Identify two melodies that sound the same across different clefs.</p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="category-section">
        <h2 class="category-title">Key-related</h2>
        <div class="nav-grid">
            <a href="/melody_key" class="nav-card">
                <h3>Identifying Key in a Melody</h3>
                <p>Identify the key of a given melody.</p>
            </a>
            <!-- Chord Progression not found in current routes, skipping -->
            <a href="/inversion" class="nav-card">
                <h3>Chord Inversion</h3>
                <p>Identify the chord inversion (Root, 1st, 2nd).</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/clef_minor" class="nav-card">
                <h3>Identify clef from minor scale</h3>
                <p>Identify the clef and minor key from the musical score.</p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="category-section">
        <h2 class="category-title">Music Knowledge</h2>
        <div class="nav-grid">
            <a href="/instrument_knowledge" class="nav-card">
                <h3>Instrumental Knowledge</h3>
                <p>Test your knowledge on instruments, clefs, and terms.</p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <hr style="margin: 40px 0; border: 0; border-top: 2px solid #eee;">

    <div class="nav-grid">
        <a href="/support_me" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Support Me ☕️</h3>
            <p>Support the development of this app.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/about_me" class="nav-card">
            <h3>About Me 😄</h3>
            <p>Learn more about the developer.</p>
        </a>
    </div>

    <footer style="margin-top: 40px; color: #5e5f88; font-size: 0.95em; font-weight: 700;">
        &copy; Chan Chak Hang Max 2026 version 2.0.0
    </footer>

    <%- include('partials/ai_chat') %>
</body>
</html>
